<title>INDIA: India June copper cathodes output 3,765 tonnes.</title>
<headline>India June copper cathodes output 3,765 tonnes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's state-run Hindustan Copper Ltd (HCL) produced 3,765 tonnes of copper cathodes in June against a target of 3,550 tonnes, a government statement said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>HCL also produced 2,251 tonnes of continous cast copper rods in June against a target of 4,200 tonnes, the statement said.</p>
<p>	    Installed     June,1997	 Cumulative output</p>
<p>	    capacity	  --			--</p>
<p>	    (annual)	 Actual	Apr-Jun 97  Apr-Jun 96</p>
<p>Copper</p>
<p> cathodes   47,500	 3,765	  10,685	8,136</p>
<p>Copper</p>
<p> rods	 60,000	 2,251	   7,867     10,689</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures are in tonnes and provisional. --New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
